          'Structural problems (value traps): A business model made obsolete by technology, a product with permanent demand destruction, an industry with permanently declining margins, or a brand that has been irreparably damaged.',
          'The key question: If management were replaced tomorrow and given unlimited capital, could the business earn a satisfactory return in five years? If yes, the problem is likely fixable.',
