          'Durable high margins are only possible in industries where all or most of the five forces are favorable to incumbents simultaneously.',
          'The most dangerous competitive threat often comes from substitute products outside the traditional industry definition.',
          'Translate each force into a margin implication and a direction of travel — that is what makes the framework actionable for valuation.',
