        text: 'Every professional trader will tell you the same thing: the mechanics of trading are learnable in months; the psychology takes years — if it ever fully develops. The most sophisticated technical analysis, the best fundamental research, and the most rigorous risk management framework will all fail systematically if the trader cannot execute the plan calmly when markets are moving against them. Trading psychology is not soft content. It is the primary variable separating traders who survive from those who blow up.',
