          'Once your in-sample strategy is finalized (no more parameter changes), run it once on the out-of-sample data and accept the result without modification.',
          'If out-of-sample performance is substantially worse than in-sample, assume the strategy is overfit and do not proceed to live trading.',
          'If out-of-sample performance is reasonably consistent with in-sample, you have passed the first gate — but this is still not a guarantee of live success.',
