          'Market impact: The price movement caused by your own order. Increases non-linearly with position size relative to average daily volume. For a $1M portfolio in large-caps: approximately 0.05-0.15% per trade.',
          'Capital gains tax (taxable accounts): Short-term capital gains (positions held less than 12 months) are taxed at ordinary income rates (up to 37% federal in the US). Long-term gains taxed at preferential rates (0-20%). High turnover in taxable accounts creates substantial short-term gains that are taxed at a severe premium.',
          'Total cost estimate by turnover level: Low turnover (20-30% annually): ~0.10-0.20% total cost. Medium turnover (50-80%): ~0.30-0.60% total cost. High turnover (200%+): ~1.0-3.0%+ total cost (tax drag dominant in taxable accounts).',
